- a domain name and a TLS certificate: the links printed on the PDFs must stay reachable;
- an SMTP relay, since access codes and rotas go out by e-mail;
- a reverse proxy in front of the application;
- 2.5 GB of memory: 2 GB for the application, 512 MB for PostgreSQL.

The full guide is in [the operations documentation](https://github.com/sylvainmetayer/planning-equipes/blob/main/docs/exploitation.md) (in French).
